'review_title': 'Antioxidant supplements for prevention of mortality in healthy participants and patients with various  
diseases', 'review_background': 'Our systematic review has demonstrated that antioxidant supplements may increase       
mortality. We have now updated this review.', 'review_objective': 'To assess the beneficial and harmful effects of      
